<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Node.js</strong> (v18+) → <a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://nodejs.org/">nodejs.org</a></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Git</strong> → <a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://git-scm.com/">git-scm.com</a></li>
