<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Skills</strong> — update the tech stack array with your skills</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Projects</strong> — add your own projects with name, description, tech used, and GitHub/live links</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Experience</strong> — update your work history or education</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 6: Swap Your Photo</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Replace the profile image file (usually in <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">public/</code> folder) with your own photo, keeping the same filename.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
