<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Option 2: If no "Run as Administrator" there either</h3>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Press <strong>Windows key + R</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Type <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">cmd</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Press <strong>Ctrl + Shift + Enter</strong> (this forces it to open as admin)</li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Option 3: Search differently</h3>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Press <strong>Windows key</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Type <strong>PowerShell</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Look on the <strong>right side panel</strong> — you should see "Run as Administrator" there</li>
</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Like this:</p>
