<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Apply from Phone using Mobile Data 📱</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">This works from anywhere — your mobile data location is enough!</p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Turn off WiFi completely</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Turn on <strong>mobile data</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to phone Settings → Location → <strong>ON</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Open Chrome on phone</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to <strong>education.github.com/students</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click reapply link from the email</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">When Chrome asks for location → tap <strong>Allow</strong></li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Before reapplying, fix these first:</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>On your phone, go to github.com:</strong></p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to <strong>Settings → Profile</strong>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Full name: <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">Bhoomi Thakur</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Save</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to <strong>Settings → Billing</strong>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Add name: <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">Bhoomi Thakur</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Save</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Student ID photo</strong> — take a new clear photo showing:
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Your name</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">SAGE University</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Year/validity date</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Then reapply with mobile data ON</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Mobile data location is usually accurate enough for GitHub to verify you're a student in India at SAGE University.</p>
