<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">While waiting, let's keep moving!</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">You can still use <strong>Copilot Free version</strong> (limited) in VS Code right now:</p>
