<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Search <strong>"GitHub Copilot"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Install it</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Sign in with <strong>Bhoomi-1401</strong> account</li>
</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Free version gives you <strong>2000 completions/month</strong> — enough to customize your portfolio!</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Once installed, here's the plan:</h3>
