<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Deploy on Vercel for FREE — takes 5 minutes!</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Step 1: Push your code to GitHub first</strong></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">In VS Code terminal run:</p>
