<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Step 2: Go to Vercel</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://vercel.com/">https://vercel.com</a></strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Sign Up"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Sign in with <strong>GitHub</strong> (Bhoomi-1401 account)</li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Step 3: Import your project</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Add New Project"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Select your <strong>Portfolio</strong> repository</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Deploy"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Wait 2-3 minutes ⏳</li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
