<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Fix: Search for it</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Type <strong>"Portfolio"</strong> in the search box on that page and see if it appears.</p>
