iv></div></div></div><div class="[content-visibility:auto] [contain-intrinsic-size:auto_400px] pb-8 -mb-8 print:[content-visibility:visible]"><div data-test-render-count="1"><div class="group" style="height: auto; opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="contents"><div data-is-streaming="false" class="group relative relative pb-3" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><h2 class="sr-only select-none">Claude responded: It's still running (the blue dot means it's processing).</h2><div class="font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2 [&amp;_.progressive-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,ul,ol,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pr-8"><div><div class="standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 standard-markdown"><p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">It's still running (the blue dot means it's processing). Just wait a moment — it might ask for your GitHub login.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">If it asks for <strong>username and password</strong>, enter:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Username: <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">Bhoomi-1401</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Password: use a <strong>Personal Access Token</strong> (not your regular password)</li>
</ul>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">If it asks for token, here's how to get one:</h3>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to <strong>github.com</strong> → Settings</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Scroll down → <strong>Developer settings</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Personal access tokens</strong> → <strong>Tokens (classic)</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Generate new token"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Select scopes: tick <strong>"repo"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Generate</strong> and copy the token</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Paste it as your password in terminal</li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
