<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://vercel.com/">https://vercel.com</a></strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Add New Project"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">You should now see <strong>"portfolio"</strong> under Bhoomi-1401</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Import"</strong> next to it</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Deploy"</strong> — don't change any settings!</li>
