<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Fix 1: Skills Icons</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">We need to download proper tech icons. Here are direct links — download each one:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Python</strong>: <a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/python/python-original.svg">https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/python/python-original.svg</a></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Pandas</strong>: <a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/pandas/pandas-original.svg">https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/pandas/pandas-original.svg</a></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>NumPy</strong>: <a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/numpy/numpy-original.svg">https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/numpy/numpy-original.svg</a></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Jupyter</strong>: <a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/jupyter/jupyter-original.svg">https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/jupyter/jupyter-original.svg</a></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>MySQL/SQL</strong>: <a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/mysql/mysql-original.svg">https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon/icons/mysql/mysql-original.svg</a></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Git</strong>: already exists ✅</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Save all these as <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.svg</code> or <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.png</code> files into <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">src/assets/</code> folder.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Fix 2: Project Images</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Take <strong>screenshots</strong> of your actual projects and save them as:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">creditwise.png</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">ipl.png</code></li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Put them in <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">src/assets/</code> folder.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Want the easiest way?</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Just download the icons by opening each link above in Chrome → right click → <strong>Save as</strong> into your <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">src/assets/</code> folder.</p>
