<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Here's what to do:</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>For CreditWise Loan System:</strong></p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Open your CreditWise project</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Take a <strong>screenshot</strong> of the app running</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Save it as <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">creditwise.png</code> in <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">src/assets/</code> folder</li>
</ol>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>For IPL Business Intelligence:</strong></p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Open your IPL dashboard/Power BI</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Take a <strong>screenshot</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Save it as <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">ipl.png</code> in <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">src/assets/</code> folder</li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">If you don't have screenshots ready:</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Just use any relevant image for now! For example:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Google <strong>"loan prediction ML"</strong> → Images → save one as <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">creditwise.png</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Google <strong>"IPL dashboard Power BI"</strong> → Images → save one as <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">ipl.png</code></li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Save both to <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">src/assets/</code> folder.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Then in <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">assets/index.js</code> add:</p>
