</span></span><span>NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
</span><span>NEXT_PUBLIC_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=</span></code></pre></div></div>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Create a <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.env.local</code> file and add your keys there!</p>
