<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Name</strong> → type <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">Gmail</code> (already filled ✅)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2"><strong>Service ID</strong> → keep <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">service_bnf4azt</code> (note this down! ✅)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Connect Account"</strong> → it will open Gmail login</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Login with <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">bhoomi.thakur168@gmail.com</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Allow the permissions</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Create Service"</strong></li>
</ol>
