<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Click on <strong>"Settings"</strong> tab at the top of the template page and you'll see the <strong>Template ID</strong> there.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Or look at the URL — it will show something like:</p>
