<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 1: Go to your LinkedIn profile</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Go to <strong>linkedin.com</strong> and click <strong>"Me"</strong> → <strong>"View Profile"</strong></p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 2: Add to Contact Info</h3>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Contact info"</strong> (pencil icon near your name)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"+"</strong> next to Website</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Add:
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">URL: <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">https://portfolio-seven-drab-98.vercel.app</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Type: <strong>Portfolio</strong></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Save</strong></li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 3: Add to Featured Section</h3>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">On your profile click <strong>"Add profile section"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Recommended"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Add featured"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"+"</strong> → <strong>"Links"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Paste: <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">https://portfolio-seven-drab-98.vercel.app</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Title: <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">🚀 My AI Engineering Portfolio</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>Save</strong></li>
</ol>
