<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">The thumbnail is auto-generated by LinkedIn from your portfolio website. To change it you need to add a proper <strong>OG Image</strong> (Open Graph image) to your portfolio.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Fix: Add OG Image to your portfolio</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Step 1:</strong> Create a nice banner image (1200x630px) with:</p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Your name: <strong>Bhoomi Thakur</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Title: <strong>AI Engineer</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Dark background</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">You can create one free at <strong><a class="underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current" href="https://canva.com/">https://canva.com</a></strong>:</p>
<ol class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-decimal flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Go to Canva</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Search <strong>"LinkedIn Banner"</strong> or custom size <strong>1200x630</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Design it with your name and title</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Download as PNG</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Save as <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">og-image.png</code> in <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">public</code> folder</li>
</ol>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Step 2:</strong> Add to <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">src/app/layout.js</code>:</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Find the metadata section and add:</p>
